  "speakers": [
   "財務長 Alice",
   "董事長 Bobby",
   "董事長",
   "盛保熙",
   "財務長 回答",
   "董事長 盛保熙",
   "財務長 官怡辰"
  ],
  "quotes": [
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "So 我們可以看到這一季我們的獲利成長性，本季是賺一季勝一季，延續第二季的動能。",
    "anchor": "00:05:20",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 9
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "季營收季增新台幣 5.64 億，營業利益季增新台幣 1.04 億。",
    "anchor": "00:05:20",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 9
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "營收新台幣 20.85 億，年增 16.9%，季減 1.5%。",
    "anchor": "00:05:20",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 9
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "全球銷售業務加速成長，三季營收新台幣 33.02 億元，年增 9.3%，季增 12.5%。",
    "anchor": "00:05:59",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 10
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "2027 年起中期能見度為歷年來最高，未來 12 個月在手訂單達 3.4 億美元，北美各場能見度充足。",
    "anchor": "00:05:59",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 10
   },
   {
    "cat": "本季實績",
    "text": "營收季增 19.3%，年增 12.5%。",
    "anchor": "00:07:58",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 13
   },
   {
    "cat": "毛利率",
    "text": "毛利率 39% 跟預期的 41% 還有空間。",
    "anchor": "00:09:35",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 16
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "馬里蘭針劑廠 2026 年受法規變動影響表現不如預期，部分在手訂單會遞延到 2027 年出貨。",
    "anchor": "00:10:35",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 18
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "那在營收對、營收從 2024 年第四季的 53.14% 逐漸下降到 33.36%。",
    "anchor": "00:12:18",
    "who": "財務長 Alice",
    "title": "財務長 Alice",
    "seg": 22
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "We're expecting to realize and continue to realize a lot of the synergies that we have with that facility and the Tanvex facility in San Diego and the Bora Biologics Zunyi facility in Taiwan.",
    "anchor": "00:15:27",
    "who": "董事長",
    "title": "董事長",
    "seg": 28
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "Okay, and then in the outlook for 2027, I split our sites into the more mature sites and our high growth facilities.",
    "anchor": "00:16:41",
    "who": "董事長",
    "title": "董事長",
    "seg": 30
   },
   {
    "cat": "營收",
    "text": "We are continuing the contract that we signed in Q2 and onboarding that company and those products into the facility, which we will see start to mature and start to show sizable revenues in the end of 2027 and into 28.",
    "anchor": "00:17:46",
    "who": "董事長",
    "title": "董事長",
    "seg": 32
   },
   {
    "cat": "展望",
    "text": "A little sneak peek into our 2027 growth and our potential and our outlook.",
    "anchor": "00:25:29",
    "who": "董事長",
    "title": "董事長",
    "seg": 48
   },
   {
    "cat": "毛利率",
    "text": "那明年整個如果產能全開，毛利率應該會回到我們以前大概 40 幾 % 的這種正常的水平。",
    "anchor": "00:37:23",
    "who": "財務長",
    "title": "財務長 回答",
    "seg": 71
   }
  ],
